es, and keep the percentage-only part plus the structurally unverified row fail closed\n- rebuild the compact cumulative projection, terminal ledger, active manifest, authenticated product readback, and real API gateway custody\n- make historical P1 and P3 regression suites successor-safe without weakening predecessor hashes, raw-byte authentication, output custody, or zero-write checks\n\n## Semantic and integrity evidence\n\n- reviewed Questions: `150 / 150` verified (`151` discoverable; `1` unverified source row excluded)\n- reviewed score-owning QuestionParts: `264 / 264`\n- approved primary parts: `263`; fail-closed non-Series part: `1`\n- approved ProcedureInstances: `353` across `7` models; reuse ratio `50.428571`\n- supporting candidates: `19` (`13` Quadratics, `6` canonical Trigonometry), all withheld from approved projection\n- singleton candidate models: `0`; alternative branches: `0`\n- cross-Paper approved model reuse: `0` because P3 generalized-binomial cues do not match positive-integer P1 evidence; canonical Trigonometry support is referenced without duplication\n- candidate-as-approved, dangling edges, duplicate identities/models, cross-family primary conflicts, structural writes, provider calls, and remote writes: `0`\n- active manifest SHA-256: `ba3f7608fb57cc02c2da48187c7de4f0078f16c44d6de8debfe57baad46cd47a`\n\n## Review repairs\n\n- removed six incidental `~T` candidates lacking a trigonometric-equation/interval-solve trigger\n- encoded `m21 q09/a/i` as infinite geometric sum followed by geometric-term derivation\n- encoded `s24 q05/b/ii` with the finite geometric-sum model\n- encoded `s19 q05/iii` as contextual interpretation, finite geometric sum, then infinite-sum bound\n- replaced stale fixed-successor assertions across historical P1/P3 regression tests with authenticated live-chain expectations\n\n## Verification\n\n- P1 semantic suites: #1744 `11/11`, #1745 `9/9`, #1746 `11/11`, #1747 `12/12`\n- P3 semantic suites: #1722 `13/13`, #1723 `9/9`, #1724 `11/11`, #1725 `12/12`, #1726 `8/8`, #1727 `8/8`\n- real non-check #1744/#1745/#1746 replays preserved exact JSON byte/size/mtime state\n- KG runtime readback: `58/58`\n- API gateway integration: `22/22`\n- deterministic Series check, targeted ESLint, Python compile, and `git diff --check`: passed\n\nCloses #1747","created_at":"2026-07-28T18:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T19:23:51Z","closed_at":"2026-07-28T19:06:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-28T19:06:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"cd954ca62a4eb6f59f65850c4f5e4476afe4d03b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1756/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1756/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1756/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/d9a2ed46162497ddadef0d9d054f8235086f57c1","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1747-p1-04-series-semantic-production","ref":"task/1747-p1-04-series-semantic-production","sha":"d9a2ed46162497ddadef0d9d054f8235086f57c1","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url